  "lesson": {
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "meta": "交互解题 · 线段最小值",
    "title": "三棱锥 $A$-$BCD$ 中，点 $B$ 在平面 $ACD$ 上的射影 $H$ 在线段 $CD$ 上。设 $M$ 是线段 $CH$ 的中点。若 $\\angle BAH=30^{\\circ}$，$AB=2$，$\\triangle ABM$、$\\triangle ABD$ 的面积均为 $1$，则线段 $CD$ 长度的最小值是",
    "answerLabel": "$CD$ 长度的最小值",
    "answerValue": "$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} + \\dfrac{3}{4}$"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "把射影放到原点",
      "content": "<p>平面 $ACD$ 取作 $z=0$，$H$ 为原点，$CD$ 沿 $x$ 轴，$BH\\perp$ 平面 $ACD$，故 $B$ 在 $z$ 轴上。</p><p>$\\angle BAH=30^{\\circ}$、$AB=2$ 推出 $|AH|=\\sqrt{3}$、$BH=1$：</p>$$\\cos 30^{\\circ}=\\dfrac{|AH|}{AB}\\implies |AH|=\\sqrt{3},\\quad B=(0,0,1).$$<p>设 $C=(-p,0,0)$、$D=(q,0,0)$，且 $p>0,q>0$ 以保证 $H$ 在线段 $CD$ 上，$CD=p+q$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Axis",
        "Plane_ACD",
        "Point_H",
        "Point_B",
        "Line_BH",
        "Len_AB",
        "Point_A",
        "Point_C",
        "Point_D"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 3.97,
        "y": 3.78,
        "z": 3.79
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "面积条件",
      "content": "<p>$M$ 是 $CH$ 中点，$M=\\left(-\\dfrac{p}{2},0,0\\right)$。$S_{\\triangle ABD}=S_{\\triangle ABM}=1$，即 $\\bigl|(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AD})\\bigr|=2$、$\\bigl|(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AM})\\bigr|=2$。</p><p>再加 $|AH|^{2}=3$，得到</p>$$p=\\dfrac{2q}{4q-1},\\qquad q\\in\\bigl[2-\\sqrt{3},\\,2+\\sqrt{3}\\bigr].$$",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_M",
        "Point_A",
        "Point_B",
        "Point_D",
        "Plane_ABD",
        "Plane_ABM",
        "Len_AB"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 3.48,
        "y": 4.69,
        "z": 3.26
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "对 $q$ 求 $CD$ 的最小值",
      "content": "<p>$CD=p+q=\\dfrac{q(4q+1)}{4q-1}$。求导得唯一驻点 $q=\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt{2}}{4}$ 落在区间内，</p>$$CD_{\\min}=\\dfrac{3}{4}+\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} + \\dfrac{3}{4}.$$<p>端点处 $CD=6\\pm\\sqrt{3}$ 都更大。故线段 $CD$ 长度的最小值为 $\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} + \\dfrac{3}{4}$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Line_CD",
        "Point_C",
        "Point_D",
        "Point_H",
        "Point_M"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 4.2,
